<div class="hero">
         <h1>Petrified Wedding of the Himalayas</h1>
        <h2>A Digital Archaeological Preservation Project of Ghora Gali Gool in Indian Occupied Kashmir</h2>
 <p class="author"> By Ashfaq Ahmed</p>
</div> <div class="content">
<h3>Abstract</h3>
<p>This project digitally documents Ghora Gali, an archaeological site in the Himalayan mountains of Indian Occupied Kashmir featuring around 200 stone sculptures.</p>
        <p>Using photography, videography, GPS geotagging, and 3D modeling,the project seeks to create an online archive preserving the material history and folklore associated with the site.</p>
<blockquote>“At Ghora Gali, history did not end. It hardened and waited.”</blockquote>
<a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank"> View Digital Archive</a>
